{%- case gem_handle -%}

  {%- when 'navratana' -%}
  <div class="gem-tab gem-tab--navratana">
    <h2>Our Promise on Navratna</h2>
     <b>Our Navratna Standard</b>
    <p>Every Precious Carats Navratna is assembled with astrological integrity, traditional accuracy, and complete transparency.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Natural gemstones only</li>
      <li>Independent certification support</li>
      <li> Full treatment disclosure</li>
      <li>Correct gemstone placement and arrangement</li>
      <li> No synthetic, glass-filled, composite, or imitation stones</li>
      <li>Transparent information and honest representation</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Because in Navratna, authenticity matters as much as symbolism.</p>
   <p>And balance begins with trust.</p>
  </div>

  {%- when 'upratnas' -%}
  <div class="gem-tab gem-tab--upratnas">
    <h2>Our Promise on Upratnas</h2>
    <b>Authenticity Without Compromise</b>
    <ul>
      <p>Every Upratna offered by PreciousCarats is selected with the same standards of integrity, transparency, and care that guide every gemstone in our collection.</p>
      <p>We believe accessibility should never come at the cost of authenticity.</p>
      <p>That means natural gemstones only, clear disclosure of treatments and enhancements, transparent information, and support for independent certification where applicable. We do not offer synthetic, composite, glass-filled, or imitation stones as natural gemstones.</p>
      <p>Whether a gemstone belongs to Navratna, Sanctum, Sacred Essentials, or Upratna, our commitment remains the same:</p>
      <p>To help you choose with clarity, confidence, and complete information.</p>
      <p>Because trust should never depend on price. </p>
    </ul>
  </div>

